    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（24联考）部队射击比赛中，5名参赛的战士共击中88次目标。已知任意2人击中的目标数量均互不相同，问射击成绩排前两名的战士至少击中了多少次目标？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "37"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "39"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "58"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "82"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          46
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          40
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-02-p046.webp",
            "alt": "等差数列与和定最值 · 母题精讲2 · 讲义第40页",
            "pdfPage": 46
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把前两名的总次数设为S，第二名设为d，第一名至少d＋1，因此如果S≤38，就一定有d≤18。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "其余三人最多分别为d－1、d－2、d－3，总次数最多S＋3d－6≤38＋54－6＝86，达不到88。所以前两名至少共39次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "14、17、18、19、20这组次数总和88，前两名19＋20＝39，能达到，所以选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "求前几名总和的最小值，要把其余名次尽量抬高，并用可行分配验证。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
