    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（22上海）某单位进行了一次绩效考评打分，满分为100分。有5位员工的平均分为90分，而且他们的分数各不相同，其中分数最低的员工得分为77分，那么排第二名的员工至少得（）分。（员工分数取整数）",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "90"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "92"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "94"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "96"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          46
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          40
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-03-p046.webp",
            "alt": "等差数列与和定最值 · 母题精讲3 · 讲义第40页",
            "pdfPage": 46
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先把平均分换成总分：5×90＝450分。最低77分已固定，设第二名为x，第一名最多100，其余两人最多x－1、x－2。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "总分最多100＋x＋(x－1)＋(x－2)＋77＝3x＋174。要达到450，必须x≥92。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "100、92、91、90、77正好总分450，分数互不相同，所以第二名最少92分，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "有满分上限时先用满分，不同整数名次再依次减1。"
        }
      ],
