    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-04-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第4题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-04",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（22联考）某单位A、B、C三个库房各存放若干台电脑，已知A库房比B库房多4台，B库房比C库房多2台，C库房和A库房共22台。如要将所有电脑发放给单位的不同部门，要求每个部门获得的电脑数量均不相同，问：最多可以发放给几个部门？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "7"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "8"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "9"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "10"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          47
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          41
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s04-t02-mother-04-p047.webp",
